  "name": "Simple Butter Cream Frosting",
  "subtitle": "A smooth, spreadable frosting for cakes and cupcakes",
  "description": "Whisked margarine and shortening form the base for this lightly salted vanilla frosting, finished with confectioners' sugar and milk.",
  "meal_type": "dessert",
